  message: "Fixed in PR #1684 (dev 416315836b). production_source_files now also returns the repository's Python scripts (.py at any depth under scripts/, or a Python shebang); they vote as referencers only, _is_production still admits only packages/*/src symbols. Behavioural evidence on a fresh self-map built at 8bc23ede1d with the CI command (python -m hypergumbo_core run . --out ...): OLD production set (385 files) -> gated 340, new 4 = the four confidence_sites functions, gone 0, i.e. the cron failure reproduced; NEW set (481 files, 96 scripts) -> gated 301, new 0, gone 35. Baseline rewritten from that map with --write-baseline: 35 keys removed, 0 added (check_id_construction x3 and unregistered_edge_meta_keys among them). Added cost: one ast.parse pass over 96 scripts, ~0.15 s, cron-only. Tests: TestRepositoryScriptsAreProductionCallers (5) + live-tree test_the_scripts_gates_are_production_callers. Residual: the cron self-tree-validation step itself has not fired since the merge; the next full-suite run is the confirmation (its sibling self-claims-gate is fixed by INV-konad / PR #1685)."  # 9c02
